     "html": "<math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>800</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> N/(C </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>. Como <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>32</mn></msqrt></mrow></math>: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>800</mn><msqrt><mn>32</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>87</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> N </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> m</mtext></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>/</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></math> Carga interior: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>85</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>87</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>66</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mi>−</mi><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> C </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace></mrow><mspace width=\"1.0em\"></mspace><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mspace width=\"0.222em\"></mspace><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"></mspace><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> nC</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></math>"
